---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Kelly Green Holdings privacy policy."
>

<nav class="bg-white border-b border-slate-200 sticky top-0 z-50">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-8 py-4 flex items-center">
    <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-x-3">
      <span class="font-extrabold text-2xl tracking-tighter text-emerald-900">KELLY GREEN</span>
      <span class="text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-[3px] text-amber-700 mt-1">HOLDINGS</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</nav>

<section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-8 py-16">
  <h1 class="text-4xl heading-serif text-emerald-900 mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>

  <div class="text-slate-600 space-y-4 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">
    <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> June 2026</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-900 mt-8 mb-3">Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>Kelly Green Holdings collects minimal information. This site does not use cookies, trackers, or analytics. If you contact us via the contact form or email, we receive the information you provide.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-900 mt-8 mb-3">How We Use Information</h2>
    <p>Any information you provide is used solely to respond to your inquiry. We do not sell, share, or distribute your personal information to third parties.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-900 mt-8 mb-3">Data Retention</h2>
    <p>We retain correspondence as needed for business records. You may request deletion of your information at any time.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-900 mt-8 mb-3">Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>This website is hosted on Vercel. Brevo handles contact form submissions. Both may collect standard server logs in accordance with their own privacy policies.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-900 mt-8 mb-3">Contact</h2>
    <p><a href="mailto:hello@kellygreenholdings.com" class="text-emerald-700 hover:text-emerald-800 font-medium">hello@kellygreenholdings.com</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<footer class="bg-emerald-950 text-emerald-200/70">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-8 py-8 text-sm text-center">
    <div class="text-xs">&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Kelly Green Holdings, LLC. All rights reserved.</div>
  </div>
</footer>

</Layout>
